category: Editors
build-depends: cygport autoconf-archive help2man libgee0.8-devel libglib2.0-devel libncurses-devel vala
sdesc: "Zile Is Lossy Emacs"
ldesc: "GNU Zile is a text editor development kit, so that you can (relatively)
quickly develop your own ideal text editor without reinventing the wheel for
many of the common algorithms and data-structures needed to do so."
skip:

homepage: https://www.gnu.org/software/zile/
